Names beginning `roux_` are roux's (its ledger, `roux_ledger`, and
`roux_old_` for a table set aside while it is rebuilt): roux-db refuses
one in schema.sql.

== before
CREATE TABLE dish (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY) STRICT;

== after
CREATE TABLE dish (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY) STRICT;
CREATE TABLE roux_old_dish (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY) STRICT;

== error
roux-db: roux_old_dish: names starting `roux_` are roux's (its ledger, and a table set aside while it is rebuilt)
